title: '? One author works when the hardest decision sits on a border inside one function.'
pid: bb270a35-8359-4b56-9b74-e7108c3d1a8f
body: |2-
  Val's and Terry's code is interleaved inside one function. Trial:
  the next request that touches it; if the author asks the other
  owner more than one or two questions, name both as authors in turn.
